<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In LightCode: Compiling LLM Inference for Photonic-Electronic Systems" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">V </span>Conclusion</span></a>
